{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00064",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.09,
      "end_seconds": 3.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Hi, I'm glad you could make it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.74,
      "end_seconds": 4.61,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Hi. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.18,
      "end_seconds": 9.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Tell me from the beginning, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.69,
      "end_seconds": 14.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "It's a ring-shaped itchy patch. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.53,
      "end_seconds": 21.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.28,
      "end_seconds": 28.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Probably about a month. Yeah. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.89,
      "end_seconds": 36.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.79,
      "end_seconds": 45.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.25,
      "text": "A eight out of ten, I suppose. It's worse with sweating. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.48,
      "end_seconds": 58.93,
      "duration_seconds": 13.45,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.13,
      "end_seconds": 61.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.15,
      "end_seconds": 65.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Any similar rash on the scalp or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.75,
      "end_seconds": 70.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Uh, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.07,
      "end_seconds": 74.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Okay, how's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.17,
      "end_seconds": 82.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.9,
      "end_seconds": 85.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.33,
      "end_seconds": 89.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.82,
      "end_seconds": 94.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.91,
      "end_seconds": 97.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.25,
      "end_seconds": 101.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.22,
      "end_seconds": 105.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "It's Candid cream, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.0,
      "end_seconds": 108.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.44,
      "end_seconds": 123.02,
      "duration_seconds": 13.58,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.56,
      "end_seconds": 127.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.53,
      "end_seconds": 131.37,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.65,
      "end_seconds": 134.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.98,
      "end_seconds": 139.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.49,
      "end_seconds": 144.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.72,
      "end_seconds": 146.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "My mother has migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.72,
      "end_seconds": 151.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.14,
      "end_seconds": 152.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.44,
      "end_seconds": 173.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.26,
      "end_seconds": 186.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.38,
      "end_seconds": 213.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temp 36.7 degrees, pulse 82, BP is 109 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.27,
      "end_seconds": 215.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.8,
      "end_seconds": 222.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.26,
      "end_seconds": 237.72,
      "duration_seconds": 14.46,
      "text": "Uh, yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.75,
      "end_seconds": 243.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.87,
      "end_seconds": 255.04,
      "duration_seconds": 10.17,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.55,
      "end_seconds": 270.56,
      "duration_seconds": 15.01,
      "text": "Putting together what you've described, this looks most like a fungal skin infection. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a ring-shaped itchy patch for about a month, and no fever or similar rash on the scalp."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.04,
      "end_seconds": 273.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.6,
      "end_seconds": 277.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.9,
      "end_seconds": 278.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.53,
      "end_seconds": 306.05,
      "duration_seconds": 18.52,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let's get a skin scraping, for suspected fungal infection. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'd like you to take terbinafine cream, once a day, for two weeks. That's for fungal infection. Keep the area dry, wear loose cotton, and don't share towels."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.25,
      "end_seconds": 320.13,
      "duration_seconds": 13.88,
      "text": "Okay. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Come back in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.56,
      "end_seconds": 325.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.37,
      "end_seconds": 330.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.76,
      "end_seconds": 338.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "So, I take the terbinafine cream, once a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.49,
      "end_seconds": 346.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Okay, yes, exactly right. Alright, take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.92,
      "end_seconds": 349.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}